# Inference model artifacts — weights are downloaded by the install
# script; TensorRT engines are device-specific so each Orin builds its
# own. None of this belongs in git. The bare `*.pt` glob also catches
# the cwd-downloaded yolo11n.pt that ultralytics auto-fetches.
# *.onnx covers the intermediate ONNX dump ultralytics writes during
# the torch → ONNX → TRT pipeline.
*.pt
*.onnx
*.engine
cameras.yaml
mediamtx/mediamtx
mediamtx/mediamtx.yml
mediamtx/*.tar.gz
recordings/
playback_cache/
cloud/oauth2-proxy.env
*.jpg
.DS_Store
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
runme.sh

# Personal recon / runbook notes — contain real credentials, MACs, and
# host-specific details. Kept locally, not committed.
camera-network-analysis.md
sadp-reset-plan.md
physical-reset-plan.md

# runpod-auto.sh failure log
last-retrain.log
